            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great guacamole! It's simple and delicious! I cut this back to 8 servings for 2 avocados. I used fresh lime juice vs. lemon juice and added just a bit of garlic and 1/4 tsp. of cumin. Perfect with warm tortilla chips!",
