            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sandhockey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Quick and easy, quite tasty recipe that has become the \"go to\" for my huge homegrown Florida green skin avocados. It does not have to be hass to be good! Fresh cilantro and green onions from my patio garden and fresh squeezed lemon along with a touch of sea salt and pepper, and this dip is ready to rock the house. Very nice recipe, thanks for sharing!",
            "datePublished": "2014-01-16T10:37:08.260Z"
          },
