              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "tantuc"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thanks for a wonderfully simple and tasty dip recipe! I used lime juice and didn't use any cilantro at all. I also added a clove of garlic and some paprika. We didn't have any leftovers!",
            "datePublished": "2011-05-07T18:20:56.037Z"
